  "macroRenderedOutput": {},
  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\" ac:breakout-mode=\"default\"><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"31226d05-937f-47af-ac44-061bc1ea8e3a\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>Bahmni docker container ships with a self-signed certificate. But to deploy in production environments, it is highly recommended to use a trusted certificate provider. See the documentation to below on how you can do this easily and freely. </p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ol start=\"1\"><li><p>Please see this YouTube training video (Feb-2023)<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TSqsrR2A-iE&amp;list=PLzknGpbejfSzEB2dT87mexJaBUsXNuZkD&amp;index=9\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TSqsrR2A-iE&amp;list=PLzknGpbejfSzEB2dT87mexJaBUsXNuZkD&amp;index=9</a> </p></li><li><p>Documentation: <ac:link ac:card-appearance=\"inline\"><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Configure Valid SSL Certificates\" ri:version-at-save=\"16\" /><ac:link-body>Configure Valid SSL Certificates</ac:link-body></ac:link> </p></li></ol></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"6d71470b-881b-4185-8b3c-c89ef8db4beb\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><strong>Running Bahmni on Docker</strong></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"pagetree\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:local-id=\"941f07ae-7994-4734-a549-6d8ce9dc5b93\" ac:macro-id=\"009df437763398885e89a28795be819b\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"root\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Running Bahmni on Docker\" ri:version-at-save=\"48\" /></ac:link></ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"startDepth\">1</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
