    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"31226d05-937f-47af-ac44-061bc1ea8e3a\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Bahmni docker container ships with a self-signed certificate. But to deploy in production environments, it is highly recommended to use a trusted certificate provider. See the documentation to below on how you can do this easily and freely. </p></div></div><ol start=\"1\"><li><p>Please see this YouTube training video (Feb-2023)<a class=\"external-link\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TSqsrR2A-iE&amp;list=PLzknGpbejfSzEB2dT87mexJaBUsXNuZkD&amp;index=9\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TSqsrR2A-iE&amp;list=PLzknGpbejfSzEB2dT87mexJaBUsXNuZkD&amp;index=9</a> </p></li><li><p>Documentation: <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/35586093/Configure+Valid+SSL+Certificates\" data-linked-resource-id=\"35586093\" data-linked-resource-version=\"16\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Valid SSL Certificates</a> </p></li></ol></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"6d71470b-881b-4185-8b3c-c89ef8db4beb\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><strong>Running Bahmni on Docker</strong></p></div></div><p>\n\n\n<div class=\"plugin_pagetree conf-macro output-inline\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-local-id=\"941f07ae-7994-4734-a549-6d8ce9dc5b93\" data-macro-id=\"009df437763398885e89a28795be819b\" data-macro-name=\"pagetree\">\n\n                        \n                \n        <ul class=\"plugin_pagetree_children_list plugin_pagetree_children_list_noleftspace\">\n            <div class=\"plugin_pagetree_children\">\n            </div>\n        </ul>\n\n        <fieldset class=\"hidden\">\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"treeId\" value=\"\" />\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"treeRequestId\" value=\"/wiki/plugins/pagetree/naturalchildren.action?decorator=none&amp;excerpt=false&amp;sort=position&amp;reverse=false&amp;disableLinks=false&amp;expandCurrent=false\" />\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"treePageId\" value=\"3217522692\" />\n\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"noRoot\" value=\"false\" />\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"rootPageId\" value=\"299630726\" />\n\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"rootPage\" value=\"\" />\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"startDepth\" value=\"1\" />\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"spaceKey\" value=\"BAH\" />\n\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"i18n-pagetree.loading\" value=\"Loading...\" />\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"i18n-pagetree.error.permission\" value=\"Unable to load page tree. It seems that you do not have permission to view the root page.\" />\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"i18n-pagetree.eeror.general\" value=\"There was a problem retrieving the page tree. Please check the server log file for more information.\" />\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"loginUrl\" value=\"/wiki/login.action?os_destination=%2Frest%2Fapi%2Fcontent%2F3217522692%3Fexpand%3Dbody.storage%2Cbody.view%2Cversion%2Cmetadata.labels%2Chistory\" />\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"mobile\" value=\"false\" />\n\n                        <fieldset class=\"hidden\">\n    